      "content": "thanks, i hope ur right. the tightness is still there but it feels a bit more like a dull ache now rather than sharp pressure. i tried the breathing thing but my arm is still feeling pretty weird and heavy. u think i should just take some ibuprofen and wait it out overnight? or is there something else i can take to help the tension go away faster?",
